# Explicit allowlist for tests/no_native_dialogs.php. One entry per line:  <path>|<token>|<reason>
# token is the call or event that is allowed in that file: alert, confirm, prompt or beforeunload. Keep this list tiny.
#
# onbeforeunload / beforeunload: the browser's own "Leave site?" prompt. A page cannot replace it with its own modal (browsers ignore
# any custom text and block every other dialog while the page unloads), so the only alternative is to drop the unsaved-changes guard.
js/app.js|beforeunload|TinyMCE unsaved-changes guard; the browser's leave-page prompt cannot be replaced by a modal
js/webhook_form.js|beforeunload|webhook form unsaved-changes guard; the browser's leave-page prompt cannot be replaced by a modal
